#! beatscript 2
#! name: swung seed
#! license: CC0-1.0
# swung-seed.beatscript: a jazz track of the beats generator, with its swing (CC0). Original.
# `seed@2(jazz, 7)` is seeds v2: the track that a bare `seed(jazz, 7)` writes out, plus jazz's swing. The generator's tables
# give jazz 60 out of 100, which v2 writes as `swing 0.6`; seeds v1 write every genre straight. Only `arrange from` brings the
# swing, because it is a setting of the whole program: a section or a part of a seed is notes. The program's own `tempo` wins
# over the track's, and its own `swing` would too. `beatscript expand` writes the track out under its `# from seed@2(jazz, 7)` line.
tempo 104
arrange from seed@2(jazz, 7)
